faq:
  - q: Can partners see our other customers?
    a: Each partner sees only their own leads and commissions. They use a separate login that is kept apart from your staff system.
  - q: How do we avoid two partners submitting the same customer?
    a: A partner lead is held at conversion when an active enquiry already exists on that phone number, and your team reviews the duplicate.
  - q: How is commission tracked?
    a: Your team records the commission amount and moves it through pending, approved and paid, with a reference and history. The partner sees the status.
  - q: Can we measure partner performance?
    a: Yes. A report shows partner leads and commissions, and enquiries keep the partner as their source for pipeline reports.
  - q: Can our own staff refer customers too?
    a: Yes. Staff can submit referrals that follow their own review process and report.
